<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average gained more than 50 points in early trading on Friday as the blue-chip stock index took its cue from a jump in bonds following positive employment data for January.</p>
<p>The Dow was up 50.80 points at 6,823.86, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
